{"id":5121,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":515,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"？？：？？ 奇兰雕像18层","style":9,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"巨大的雕像外墙在黑帮火拼中被炸出巨大的破口，露出内部的逃生阶梯。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"一个高瘦的男人就站在那里，举着伞，看向下方的谈判大厅，和整个广场。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？","content":"嗯，我还在。能看到这般美妙的景象，我辛苦工作也算值得了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？","content":"久违的奇迹很快就要降临，你现在心情如何，有开心点吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？","content":"呵呵，抱歉抱歉，让你等了这么久。计划赶不上变化，总是要及时调整的，原谅我吧？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"？？","content":"毕竟最后，几年项目结束，我也算超额完成目标了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"谈判大厅发生爆炸，紫光伴着成簇的利刺掀翻楼顶，巨大的轰鸣声撼动男人脚下的地面。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"？？","content":"吵到你了？有些几个小家伙闯进来，挣扎着做点热场节目。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"？？","content":"他们管这叫<color=#fb9259>枷锁</color>吧？大概是那年偷走的技术拿去改造了一下，拴住了几只羔羊，也算给我们的计划带来点小意外。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"？？","content":"不过，也多亏了他们，我才找到这么好的种子。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"辛迪加结出了最好的种子，强大，纯粹，热烈，无所畏惧——是□最偏爱的敢反抗他的人。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"就算先被别人刻下印记也没关系，抢过来就行了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"他看着被暴露在外的战场，看着那个不停颤动的人。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"voice":["vo_cgplot_5121015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":18,"background":50502,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？","content":"可怜可爱的人，继续这无望的挣扎吧。这份美丽的意志也会成为<color=#fb9259>环</color>的装点。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":50502,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长……你……没事吧？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"赫卡蒂脸色惨白，颤抖着握住你的手。海拉也虚弱不已，036被留在外面，生死未卜。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"那只邪恶的眼睛瞪视着你，从中你感到满满的憎恶、嫉恨和嘲弄。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"卓娅？","content":"破坏……结束……结束这一切！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"再对卓娅使用枷锁，只会加重海拉和赫卡蒂的负担。但你们也没有退路，必须战斗。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"她的战斗不该如此。你不能让她就这么被夺走。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"options":["抱歉，赫卡蒂。再把力量借给我"],"jump":[25],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我会的，无论何时。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121024"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"阻止她吧，局长。只有你可以。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5121025"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1}]}